sort-help-help = Siggez talɣut n tallalt.
sort-help-version = Siggez talɣut n lqem.
sort-random-source-end-of-file = { $path }: taggara n ufaylu
sort-about = Sdukkel agbur n meṛṛa IFUYLA, smizzwer izirigen-is, syin sken-it-id. Ma ulac AFAYLU, neɣ ma AFAYLU d -, ɣeṛ anekcum amagnu.
sort-usage = sort [TAXTIṚT]... [AFAYLU]...
sort-after-help =
    Amasal n tsarut d URTI[.ASEKKIL][TIXṬIṚIN][,URTI[.ASEKKIL]][TIXṬIṚIN].

    S wudem amezwer, urtan ttwaferqen s usekkil ilem amezwaru i d-iḍefren asekkil ur nelli ara d ilem. Seqdec -t i ubdar n unabraz udmawan.
    Deg tegnit tamezwert, isekkilen ilmawen ttwarennan deg tazwara n yal urti. Ma d inabrazen udmawanen, ur ttwasddukklen ara deg wurtan.

    URTI d USEKKIL bdan seg 1 (anamek-is, asiḍen n yidigen-nsen yebda seg 1). Ma ulac taggara i d-yettwabedren deffir ticcert, taggara ad tili d tin n uzirig.
    Ma ASEKKIL yettwasbadu ɣer 0, anamek-is d taggara n wurti. S wudem amezwer, ASEKKIL d 1 i yideg n tazwara, d 0 i yideg n taggara.

    Tixṭiṛin timeɣta d: MbdfhnRrV. Ssemselsint tixṭiṛin timatutin i tsarut-a.
